WEBVTT

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:03.380
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:06.330
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.270
In order to focus on my acting career, I, Kamiya Shion,

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:13.950
will not be joining STAR☆ANIS.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.750
You did well on your summer tour.

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:27.720
It was a wonderful success.

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:30.000
Good job, STAR☆ANIS!

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:33.560
Your activities as a unit are over for the time being.

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:36.930
I want to see all of you jump straight back to your individual units.

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:38.260
Okay!

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:41.790
It's STAR☆ANIS!

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:43.270
They're so cute!

00:00:50.540 --> 00:00:56.280
Thanks to their summer tour, each member of STAR☆ANIS has started shining more and more!

00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:59.330
They're blinding!

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:00.550
Yeah!

00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:05.290
Tristar, Soleil, and Powa Powa Puririn's combined unit, STAR☆ANIS,

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:07.790
blew the world away!

00:01:07.790 --> 00:01:11.100
Okay, girls, thanks for your hard work.

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:12.800
Same to you!

00:01:14.110 --> 00:01:16.200
Everyone's eyes are on us.

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:19.870
It's proof that our time on tour really grabbed everyone's attention.

00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:22.810
Starting today, Soleil will take back the spotlight.

00:01:22.810 --> 00:01:27.720
The first item on Powa Powa Puririn's menu is a cake tasting!

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:28.610
Okay!

00:01:29.790 --> 00:01:31.320
Look who it is!

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:33.320
Shion-tan!

00:01:35.210 --> 00:01:37.320
Shion-chan!

00:01:38.080 --> 00:01:39.820
I've missed you so much!

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:43.240
We have finally assembled once again.

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:44.910
It's almost time, Shion.

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:46.960
Do your best on the drama audition.

00:01:47.430 --> 00:01:48.270
I will.

00:01:48.270 --> 00:01:50.330
We'll be cheering for you, Shion-chan.

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:52.380
Thanks.

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:33.810
There's a recording for "Naughty Detectives" today, is there not?

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:34.480
That's right.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:37.900
Kiriya and Kamiya's popularity as rookie detectives

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:39.490
is wiggling through the roof! {change}

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:43.990
As I recall, Kamiya's audition for "Alice in Wonderland" is...

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:46.370
Tomorrow! There's only one day left.

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:51.270
Right. I'm impressed that Kamiya decided to try to take on the role of Alice.

00:03:51.270 --> 00:03:52.370
What?

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:55.880
Alice is a cute girl with a dazzling smile.

00:03:56.190 --> 00:03:59.630
It's a completely different role from any she's tried to act before. {pet peeve}

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:02.140
Now <i>that's</i> what I call exciting.

00:04:05.780 --> 00:04:08.100
Prepare to start filming!

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:10.350
Ready, and...

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:23.680
Nicely done.

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:27.740
<i>That smile...</i>

00:04:27.740 --> 00:04:29.440
Cut!

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:31.980
Ichigo-chan, that was a great smile.

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:33.660
Thank you very much.

00:04:36.180 --> 00:04:38.690
Next up is Kiriya-san and Kamiya-san's scene.

00:04:38.690 --> 00:04:39.300
Okay.

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:40.550
C-Coming!

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:43.600
Aoi, Shion-chan, you can do it!

00:04:46.350 --> 00:04:47.850
Good work.

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:49.460
Same to you.

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:52.680
It's been a while since we've had the face-planting rookie on set.

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:55.810
Looks like a lot of people have been wanting to see you.

00:04:57.190 --> 00:04:59.520
From here on out, I'll keep on doing my best...

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:00.890
to face-plant!

00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:03.650
Move it!

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:05.480
You take care of him, partner.

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:06.070
Roger.

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:10.380
Dammit!

00:05:12.080 --> 00:05:13.830
Shion-chan's so cool!

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:16.830
Always hunting down criminals with a stony face.

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:21.300
That cold-hearted type of role suits Shion the best.

00:05:22.800 --> 00:05:24.580
Criminal apprehended!

00:05:27.690 --> 00:05:28.800
It's alright now.

00:05:30.610 --> 00:05:32.310
Thank you, Miss Detective! {just use Onee-chan?} {I usually use Onee-chan only for habitual addresses}

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:35.100
And we're good.

00:05:36.150 --> 00:05:38.100
You two had perfect timing.

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:38.980
Thank you!

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:40.360
Could you...

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:42.670
...smile like that one more time?

00:05:47.540 --> 00:05:49.150
Love you!

00:05:49.150 --> 00:05:53.620
It's time for some cake to celebrate 
Powa Powa Puririn starting up again.

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:57.210
I can't wait anymore!

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:04.010
Delicious!

00:06:04.410 --> 00:06:05.730
Such nice smiles...

00:06:07.100 --> 00:06:10.290
The final audition for Alice's role is tomorrow.

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:12.260
I wish I could've taken it too.

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:15.250
We missed both the interviews and the photo screening.

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:18.770
There's nothing we could've done because of how packed STAR☆ANIS's schedule was.

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:24.400
I heard that this rendition of "Alice in Wonderland" is going to have an original story.

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:25.770
Original how?

00:06:27.350 --> 00:06:29.070
Alice chases the White Rabbit, {should really just be "a rabbit" but ehhhhhhhh}

00:06:29.690 --> 00:06:31.820
and then falls down a hole.

00:06:35.010 --> 00:06:37.590
She then meets the March Hare and the Hatter.

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:43.080
They all try to keep her there forever, but fail.

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:49.130
Then, on her way home, Alice gets lost in the Queen of Hearts' garden

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:52.340
and is once again asked to stay in Wonderland forever.

00:06:53.980 --> 00:06:57.960
Alice then enters a contest with the Queen to win her right to return home.

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:01.650
Alice wins the contest,

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:04.650
and is allowed to leave.

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:08.380
She then shows off a cute and dazzling smile. {because this part is so important}

00:07:09.570 --> 00:07:11.820
A cute and dazzling smile?

00:07:12.970 --> 00:07:18.110
And on top of that, the script says that Alice has to make up some of her lines on the spot.

00:07:18.110 --> 00:07:20.290
No way, I couldn't do that.

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:24.710
Apparently, the director said he wanted to create an Alice that no one has ever seen before.

00:07:27.080 --> 00:07:29.970
Shion-sama, are you not going to eat your cake?

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:33.020
You must be worried about something important

00:07:33.020 --> 00:07:35.470
if you aren't even eating a cake filled with this much Love You! {it's fine as is, except it was way too long}

00:07:35.910 --> 00:07:38.220
It's nothing important...

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:39.740
What's wrong?

00:07:39.740 --> 00:07:43.020
I need to get back to my room to prepare for the audition.

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:46.940
Shion-chan?

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:51.110
This is probably because she passed up the chance to join STAR☆ANIS to pursue her acting career.

00:07:51.110 --> 00:07:54.130
She must be feeling the pressure to pass.

00:08:01.770 --> 00:08:02.700
Wrong...

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:06.840
This isn't a smile befitting Alice.

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:14.840
Yes?

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:16.600
It's me, Aoi.

00:08:20.820 --> 00:08:21.850
What's up?

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:23.320
Criminal apprehended.

00:08:23.320 --> 00:08:24.100
Huh?!

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:26.070
Aren't we partners?

00:08:26.070 --> 00:08:27.750
You can tell me anything.

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:29.820
I won't let go until you do.

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:37.090
I was just worried about tomorrow's audition.

00:08:41.810 --> 00:08:44.000
I think you're amazing, Shion-chan.

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:48.250
You don't let yourself get distracted from your goal of becoming an actress.

00:08:49.300 --> 00:08:53.500
It's my dream to continue acting forever.

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:56.760
That's why I need to continue improving myself.

00:08:56.760 --> 00:08:58.100
But why?

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:01.690
Don't they call you the "Actress of Seven Faces, Shion-chan"?

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:03.520
Seven isn't enough!

00:09:05.590 --> 00:09:08.770
That's the reason I decided to try out for this role.

00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:13.530
It's just that I've never played a character remotely like Alice,

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:16.770
so I'm not sure if I can do it...

00:09:18.530 --> 00:09:19.660
I see.

00:09:19.660 --> 00:09:22.240
So that's what Shion's worrying about.

00:09:22.240 --> 00:09:23.160
Yeah.

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:26.870
Shion-chan's always played cool and stoic characters.

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:31.420
It's true that Alice is really different from the image Shion's built for herself.

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:33.170
It's a huge challenge for her.

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:34.480
A challenge...

00:09:38.090 --> 00:09:39.430
It's the headmistress.

00:09:40.400 --> 00:09:41.560
Hello.

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:44.970
Hoshimiya? Could you come to my office right now?

00:09:44.970 --> 00:09:46.060
It's important.

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:47.250
Important?

00:09:57.720 --> 00:09:59.070
Hey, hey! {"ne, ne" is like, so not polite}

00:09:59.070 --> 00:10:02.350
Kamiya-san, you go to Starlight Academy, right?

00:10:02.350 --> 00:10:04.010
Yeah, I do.

00:10:04.010 --> 00:10:06.910
Then do you know the STAR☆ANIS girls?

00:10:08.090 --> 00:10:09.150
A bit...

00:10:10.580 --> 00:10:12.280
Must be nice.

00:10:12.280 --> 00:10:15.760
Hey, what are the STAR☆ANIS girls like offstage?

00:10:15.760 --> 00:10:17.370
They're...

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:20.460
Kamiya Shion-san?

00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:22.340
You're up.

00:10:22.340 --> 00:10:23.470
Okay.

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:31.770
Nice to meet you. I'm the director, Muraki.

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:34.730
I'm Kamiya Shion from Starlight Academy.

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:36.490
Thank you for this opportunity.

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:39.020
We'll be recording today.

00:10:39.020 --> 00:10:42.660
The White Rabbit and the rest of the cast will be here as well,

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:45.170
so please treat this as you would the real thing.

00:10:45.170 --> 00:10:46.030
I will.

00:10:46.930 --> 00:10:48.910
<i>I wonder who they'll be played by... {technically, "whom"}</i>

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:51.130
Everyone on standby!

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:56.220
Are you prepared?

00:10:56.220 --> 00:10:57.080
I'm ready!

00:10:57.080 --> 00:10:57.920
Now then...

00:10:58.370 --> 00:11:00.410
Ready, start!

00:11:01.810 --> 00:11:03.430
What beautiful weather.

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:05.830
I feel like something wonderful might happen today!

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:07.140
Oh no!

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:09.060
I'm gonna be late!

00:11:10.960 --> 00:11:12.020
<i>Ichigo-chan?!</i>

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:13.840
Good morning.

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:16.520
Good morning, Orihime-san.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:19.030
Director Muraki?

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:19.820
Yes.

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:24.030
He was the one who directed the 
Angely Bear commercial you were in.

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:26.700
I remember he was really helpful.

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:29.890
That very same Director Muraki who has only done commercials up until now

00:11:29.890 --> 00:11:32.580
wants to delve into moviemaking.

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:34.590
His first movie will be "Alice in Wonderland".

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:38.090
Huh? Isn't that the movie that Shion-chan's auditioning for?

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:41.700
The very same. By the way, all of the other actors

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:44.670
have come down with colds.

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:52.100
That's why Director Muraki requested me to ask if you'd be interested in playing the White Rabbit.

00:11:52.410 --> 00:11:53.980
What do you think?

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:54.560
I'll do it!

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:57.540
Do you think you can remember your lines by tomorrow?

00:11:58.480 --> 00:11:59.690
I'll do my best!

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:00.860
However...

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:06.870
He's also told me that, depending on how things develop tomorrow, he's expecting quite a few ad-libs.

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:10.370
He wants to see a White Rabbit that only you can play.

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:13.370
My own White Rabbit?

00:12:14.280 --> 00:12:16.830
Oh my ears and whiskers!

00:12:16.830 --> 00:12:19.630
There's no more time! I've gotta hurry!

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:21.720
<i>Why is Ichigo-chan here?</i>

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:24.390
<i>Forget that, I need to focus on my acting!</i>

00:12:27.230 --> 00:12:29.390
I won't make it!

00:12:30.090 --> 00:12:31.390
She didn't make it to the hole...

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:33.390
What a face-plant. {do we need consistency?} {you mean between the ikedeka tripping and this? it'd be nice}

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:34.940
Ow-ow-ow...

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:38.520
<i>What now? The story can't proceed if we don't fall down the hole!</i>

00:12:40.740 --> 00:12:42.560
Are you okay, Mister Rabbit?

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:44.900
I'm fine, um...

00:12:44.900 --> 00:12:45.650
I'm Alice.

00:12:45.650 --> 00:12:46.410
Alice!

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:51.430
So, Mister Rabbit, weren't you in a hurry?

00:12:53.730 --> 00:12:55.170
Oh, that's right!

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:56.930
C'mon Alice, let's go!

00:12:56.930 --> 00:12:57.630
Where to?

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:59.420
Let's get a move on!

00:13:05.270 --> 00:13:07.430
Sorry we're late!

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:11.390
You finally made it.

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:12.930
Sure kept us waiting. {to make it shorter}

00:13:12.930 --> 00:13:14.240
<i>Huh?!</i>

00:13:24.860 --> 00:13:29.740
Alice, these are my friends, the March Hare and the Hatter.

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:30.870
Pleased to meet you.

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:34.870
<i>My god, I wasn't expecting Aoi-chan and Ran to be here too...</i>

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:36.870
<i>What's going on here?</i>

00:13:36.870 --> 00:13:40.230
She really refused to join STAR☆ANIS?

00:13:40.230 --> 00:13:40.880
Yes.

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:42.860
But why pass up such a big chance?

00:13:42.860 --> 00:13:45.820
She's long since decided to live life as an actress.

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:49.180
To that end, she resolved to break out of her shell.

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:54.630
As she is now, she won't fail a single audition that meets her current character.

00:13:54.630 --> 00:13:57.920
But without change, an actress cannot mature.

00:13:57.920 --> 00:14:02.190
That's why she's steeled herself for anything and is trying out for a new kind of role.

00:14:02.980 --> 00:14:05.690
I'm glad that Ichigo-chan and her friends could make it today.

00:14:06.870 --> 00:14:09.720
By seeing her friends come out of nowhere,

00:14:09.720 --> 00:14:12.740
or watching as the White Rabbit falls over before making it down the rabbit hole,

00:14:13.260 --> 00:14:16.910
Kamiya-kun might find a side of herself {maybe concatenate this with the next time?}

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:18.210
she never knew existed.

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:19.670
You're right.

00:14:20.740 --> 00:14:22.770
<i>It doesn't matter who I'm acting with.</i>

00:14:23.740 --> 00:14:25.280
<i>I am Alice!</i>

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:28.110
Would you like a sandwich?

00:14:28.110 --> 00:14:30.470
The strawberry shortcake is superbly sweet. {I thought of "Ichigo's cake" when I first heard "Ichigo no cake"}

00:14:30.470 --> 00:14:33.280
Thank you all. This has been a wonderfully fun tea party.

00:14:33.280 --> 00:14:35.670
Then you should just stay here with us forever!

00:14:36.230 --> 00:14:38.440
Tomorrow and the day after and every day after that! {sorry if this is an actual line}

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:40.730
There's no need to end our terrific tea party!

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:42.760
How about it, Alice?

00:14:42.760 --> 00:14:43.810
I can't...

00:14:43.810 --> 00:14:45.300
Aren't you having fun?

00:14:45.300 --> 00:14:47.240
I am, but still...

00:14:47.620 --> 00:14:49.240
I need to go back home.

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:50.390
Why?

00:14:50.390 --> 00:14:51.740
There's something I need to do.

00:14:51.740 --> 00:14:53.750
I have a dream.

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:54.530
A dream?

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:57.750
Yes, and that's why I absolutely need to return home.

00:14:57.750 --> 00:14:59.570
I love dreams!

00:14:59.570 --> 00:15:00.640
Me too.

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:03.600
But if you want to go home, then you'll need to pass through <i>that</i> garden...

00:15:03.600 --> 00:15:04.750
What garden?

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:06.450
You should just give up.

00:15:06.450 --> 00:15:08.970
That's the scariest garden in the world.

00:15:08.970 --> 00:15:11.970
I see... so that's the way home.

00:15:12.870 --> 00:15:16.460
No matter how scary it may be, I have to go. {parallel-ness}

00:15:16.460 --> 00:15:17.250
Wait!

00:15:17.250 --> 00:15:18.270
You mustn't!

00:15:18.790 --> 00:15:20.160
Alice!

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:35.800
And just who are you?

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:38.990
No matter how I look, you can't not be suspicious.

00:15:38.990 --> 00:15:41.690
Yes! Who told you you could come in?!

00:15:41.690 --> 00:15:43.700
This is the Queen's garden.

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:45.630
You must not enter without permission.

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:46.800
The Queen?

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:53.140
Who dares to tread upon my private garden?

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:54.390
<i>No way!</i>

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:58.890
I bet she didn't expect Mizuki of all people to show up as well. {Why the hell is director-san not watching the scenes in person}

00:15:58.890 --> 00:16:01.810
This is the perfect test to determine if she can remain in character

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:04.810
even when suddenly faced with a top idol.

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:06.390
My name is Alice.

00:16:06.390 --> 00:16:08.320
It's a pleasure to make your acquaintance, my Queen.

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:09.530
Perfect!

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:11.450
Can you play croquet?

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:12.310
Croquet?

00:16:12.310 --> 00:16:13.570
Yes, watch me.

00:16:13.940 --> 00:16:15.170
This is how you play.

00:16:16.030 --> 00:16:19.040
Hooray, hooray, Queen of Hearts!

00:16:28.160 --> 00:16:30.010
The Queen's more than just a strong heart!

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:32.010
Now it's your turn.

00:16:48.560 --> 00:16:51.190
Hooray, hooray, Queen of Hearts!

00:17:10.690 --> 00:17:13.380
Hooray, hooray, Queen of Hearts!

00:17:34.490 --> 00:17:35.530
<i>This is fun.</i>

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:37.470
<i>I'm having so much fun!</i>

00:17:41.320 --> 00:17:44.710
<i>I love acting more than anything.</i>

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:46.310
<i>This is where I belong!</i>

00:17:46.310 --> 00:17:48.120
<i>I want to act forever!</i>

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:51.130
Alice, aren't you having the time of your life?

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:52.130
I am.

00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:54.480
Then why don't you stay here forever?

00:17:54.480 --> 00:17:58.680
Let's play croquet tomorrow and the day after and every day after that.

00:17:59.810 --> 00:18:04.520
I'm honored, my Queen, but I really have to return home.

00:18:05.780 --> 00:18:08.920
How could you reject the Queen's personal request?!

00:18:08.920 --> 00:18:11.880
She is saying this for your own good!

00:18:11.880 --> 00:18:13.910
No, I'm going home.

00:18:14.980 --> 00:18:17.530
I have a dream that I want to achieve.

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:18.460
A dream? {so deliciously condescending}

00:18:18.460 --> 00:18:19.330
Yes.

00:18:21.510 --> 00:18:24.540
I see. Then you may return to your home.

00:18:25.800 --> 00:18:27.080
Really?

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:28.790
Yes, but...

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:30.790
only if you can defeat me in a match.

00:18:31.870 --> 00:18:33.630
If you lose,

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:37.050
you, those rabbits, and that Hatter too,

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:38.550
will be turned into that!

00:18:39.920 --> 00:18:41.050
Wood.

00:18:42.800 --> 00:18:44.410
Now, make your choice.

00:18:44.410 --> 00:18:46.310
Will you stay here forever?

00:18:47.070 --> 00:18:49.810
Or perhaps you'll take your chances and try to go home?

00:18:49.810 --> 00:18:54.070
Do you intend to put your friends in danger for your own selfish dreams?

00:18:54.070 --> 00:18:56.570
Are you prepared to be turned into the likes of him?

00:18:56.570 --> 00:19:00.570
I only got here recently, but I'm having a blast.

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:02.820
Love you, Alice-tan! {...how menacing} {I know}

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:08.770
My Queen...

00:19:09.530 --> 00:19:11.780
I will stay he—

00:19:11.780 --> 00:19:13.210
You can't, Alice!

00:19:14.240 --> 00:19:16.220
You said you have a dream, right?

00:19:16.220 --> 00:19:17.960
You can't give up now!

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:20.400
She's right! You need to go home!

00:19:20.400 --> 00:19:22.470
Don't worry about us three.

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:24.200
Girls...

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:34.730
I have a dream that I absolutely have to achieve.

00:19:38.220 --> 00:19:39.230
So...

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:41.300
I accept your challenge!

00:19:58.550 --> 00:19:59.760
It fell to pieces!

00:20:00.960 --> 00:20:03.560
It appears Alice has won, my Queen.

00:20:03.560 --> 00:20:04.260
Certainly.

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:06.780
I'm a bit disappointed.

00:20:06.780 --> 00:20:09.150
I wish you could have stayed here with us.

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:14.590
This hairpiece will guide you to the road home.

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:18.170
My Queen...

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:20.920
We've reached the final scene.

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:21.650
Yes.

00:20:22.020 --> 00:20:25.160
It's the climax where Alice reveals her dream.

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:29.540
I've left all the lines up to her for this scene.

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:33.400
What will Kamiya's Alice's dream be?

00:20:33.920 --> 00:20:37.170
Alice, before you go, would you tell us your dream?

00:20:38.510 --> 00:20:40.050
My dream...

00:20:42.230 --> 00:20:43.920
...is to become an actress!

00:20:47.970 --> 00:20:49.830
A dazzling smile!

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:53.440
It is that dream that gave you strength.

00:20:54.110 --> 00:20:55.940
Never let it go.

00:20:56.380 --> 00:20:57.960
We'll always support you.

00:21:00.090 --> 00:21:01.440
Thank you so much.

00:21:02.690 --> 00:21:03.860
Alice!

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:04.970
Take care.

00:21:04.970 --> 00:21:06.450
Alice.

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:07.700
You did it!

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:08.820
I did!

00:21:09.950 --> 00:21:11.980
I reached my happy end! {fine...}

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:21.960
With you, I think we can create an Alice no one's ever seen before.

00:21:22.970 --> 00:21:25.230
You've got the part.

00:21:25.810 --> 00:21:27.340
Thank you so much!

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:29.260
Yay!

00:21:29.260 --> 00:21:30.220
Congrats!

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:35.830
Shion-chan, your Alice was super cute.

00:21:36.370 --> 00:21:39.730
To be honest, I actually regretted it a bit.

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:42.230
When I saw how brightly you were all shining,

00:21:42.550 --> 00:21:46.390
I thought that it might've been better if I had joined STAR☆ANIS too.

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:50.300
But now I understand.

00:21:50.300 --> 00:21:53.160
I love being an actress.

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:56.870
I'm going to keep challenging myself by trying out for new roles!

00:21:56.870 --> 00:21:57.990
Great!

00:22:05.970 --> 00:22:08.380
Maybe I should challenge something too. {argh challenge doesn't even seem like a real word anymore}

00:22:09.510 --> 00:22:14.720
When I saw Shion-chan acting today, I felt like I should go out there and challenge myself too.

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:16.230
That sounds good to me.

00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:17.520
Yeah!

00:23:55.870 --> 00:23:57.830
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:23:58.970 --> 00:24:02.270
You can't help but smile when you eat delicious food. {This is actually super false, wtf. Who smiles when they're eating?}

00:24:02.270 --> 00:24:05.300
That's why you're so cute when you're eating cake. {one-line-ify}

00:24:05.300 --> 00:24:07.460
Aye! Same to you!

00:24:07.950 --> 00:24:09.920
Delicious smiles are cute.

00:24:10.490 --> 00:24:12.970
Suzukawa! I won't approve of your music!

00:24:12.970 --> 00:24:15.970
Ichigo, that guy's actually part of that popular band!

00:24:15.970 --> 00:24:18.430
Why was he talking to Suzukawa-san the groundskeeper?

00:24:18.430 --> 00:24:19.820
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:19.820 --> 00:24:21.580
More-Than-True Crisis!

00:24:21.580 --> 00:24:26.070
Always passionate, Idol Activities!
